        <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classList" kindref="compound">List</ref> of incoming edges.</para><para>Returns a sublist of edges whose target vertex is this vertex. The return value is a pair of iterators which delineate the edges. The traversal is in no particular order. <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1Graph_1_1Edge" kindref="compound">Edge</ref> iterators are equality-comparable with one another even when the come from different sublists. See <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1Graph_1_1EdgeIterator" kindref="compound">EdgeIterator</ref> for details.</para><para><ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Time" kindref="compound">Time</ref> complexity is constant. </para>        </detaileddescription>
